sequenceDiagram
  participant E as Event Stream
  participant W as WorkflowAgent
  participant M as Workflow Memory
  participant G as Guard
  participant D as Doctor
  E->>W: ClinicalEvent
  W->>M: OBSERVE context
  W->>W: REASON and PLAN
  W->>W: ACT through allowlisted tools
  W->>G: VERIFY candidate change
  G-->>D: finding / review required
  D->>G: accept, reject, or edit
  G-->>M: persist approved result
